  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## v1.40.0 (minor)\n\nChanges since v1.39.0:\n\n- Match a migrated property to its member's exact name before ignoring case [patch] (#385) (matt-edmondson)\n- Keep a format 0 member description whatever order the file writes it in [patch] (#386) (matt-edmondson)\n- Test that a description ending in a backslash keeps the declaration after it (#390) (matt-edmondson)\n- Report an enum value named value__ as reserved [patch] (#391) (matt-edmondson)\n- Report a code generator namespace its language cannot write [minor] (#392) (matt-edmondson)",
